COMMENT ON COLUMN public.stage2_result.features IS 'Fired stage-2 features: JSON array of {id, lane, weight, value, detail?}; may be empty. Every id is a stage-2 row of the feature table.';


--
-- Name: COLUMN stage2_result.evidence; Type: COMMENT; Schema: public; Owner: -
--

COMMENT ON COLUMN public.stage2_result.evidence IS 'Snapshot of the metadata that explains the score: a JSON object with one key per source (registry, ecosystems_package, ecosystems_publisher, depsdev, github_commit, rdap). Personal data: account names. E-mail addresses are reduced to the domain by trigger. Emptied by the retention job.';


--
-- Name: COLUMN stage2_result.sources; Type: COMMENT; Schema: public; Owner: -
--

COMMENT ON COLUMN public.stage2_result.sources IS 'What was asked of each source and what was skipped by quota: a JSON object keyed by source; repeat_of holds the seq of the alert this event repeats.';


--
-- Name: COLUMN stage2_result.engine; Type: COMMENT; Schema: public; Owner: -
